  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "台灣路"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<h2>Tâi-oân Lō͘&nbsp;</h2><div><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">（本文是漢羅合用kap全羅馬字一段一段對照）</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b><br /></b></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>作者：陳雷</b></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">過--來ê 50年，對台灣影響上大--ê應該是地球ê環境變化。不過，che m̄是lán今仔日討論ê問題。Lán beh講--ê是台灣ê政治環境。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Kòe--lâi ê 50 nî, tùi Tâi-oân éng-hióng siōng tōa ê eng-kai sī tē-kiû ê khoân-kéng piàn-hòa. Put-kò, che m̄ sī lán kin-á-ji̍t thó-lūn ê būn-tê. Lán beh kóng--ê sī Tâi-oân ê chèng-tī khoân-kéng.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Lán有400冬被殖民ê歷史，真知台灣人ê安全kap自由需要獨立主權ê國家，chiah ē-tàng保證。Chit條就是lán beh行ê台灣路。但是chit條路m̄是狹chiⁿ ê國家主義。因為lán ê地理是海洋，lán ê海四邊開放，人人來往，lán也是自然ê國際主義者。Kap全世界ê國家平等來往。國際主義hō͘ lán進步、富裕、安全。所以台灣路有雙chōa，主權國家kap合作ê國際主義。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Lán ū 400 tang pī si̍t-bîn ê le̍k-sú, chin chai Tâi-oân-lâng ê an-choân kap chū-iû su-iàu to̍k-li̍p chú-koân ê kok-ka, chiah ē-tàng pó-chèng. Chit tiâu tō sī lán beh kiâⁿ ê Tâi-oân lō͘. Tān-sī chit tiâu lō͘ m̄ sī e̍h-chiⁿ ê kok-ka chú-gī. In-ūi lán ê tē-lí sī hái-iûⁿ, lán ê hái sì-piⁿ khai-hòng, lâng-lâng lâi-óng, lán iā sī chū-jiân ê kok-chè chú-gī chiá. Kap choân sè-kài ê kok-ka pêng-téng lâi-óng. Kok-chè chú-gī hō͘ lán chìn-pō͘, hù-jū, an-choân. Só͘-í Tâi-oân lō͘ ū siang chōa, chú-koân kok-ka kap ha̍p-chok ê kok-chè chú-gī.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">上kài反對台灣路--ê是中國共產黨政權。In beh侵占台灣、控制台灣。In ê野心是最後控制全世界ê人kap資源，親像in chit-má控制全中國仝款。Che是目前台灣上大ê危險，第一敵人。Lán一定tio̍h看真in ê本質，chiah ē-tàng保護家己。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Siōng-kài hoán-tùi Tâi-oân lō͘--ê sī Tiong-kok Kiōng-sán-tóng chèng-koân. In beh chhim-chiàm Tâi-oân, khòng-chè Tâi-oân. In ê iá-sim sī chòe-āu khòng-chè choân sè-kài ê lâng kap chu-goân, chhin-chhiūⁿ in chit-má khòng-chè choân Tiong-kok kāng-khoán. Che sī bo̍k-chêng Tâi-oân siōng tōa ê hûi-hiám, tē-it te̍k-jîn. Lán it-tēng tio̍h khòaⁿ-chin in ê pún-chit, chiah ē-tàng pó-hō͘ ka-tī.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">台灣路坎坎坷坷，用lán ê智慧、眼光，決心ná行ná開路。Che是lán獨獨一條好koh長ê出路。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tâi-oân lō͘ kham-kham-khek-khek, iōng lán ê tì-hūi, gán-kong, koat-sim ná kiâⁿ ná khui-lō͘. Che sī lán to̍k-to̍k 1 tiâu hó koh tn̂g ê chhut-lō͘.</span></div></div></div><div><br /></div></div></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span><b>#寫hō͘學生朋友ê代誌&nbsp;</b></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">專欄，</span><span><b>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap傳統白話字。</b></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報334期，2022年1月出刊。</b></span></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span></p><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgmht-2dq5Zyjo-sEvWtUnhrElyodtAIyygsm-8j5grC08bzmj32HSsVN6rZW2hPw0o-05csNLdDQ5fwiJ_OqwQuSHW5iEJYF2etSKgtdgMw9pzgYq_qLmmNv7VGLGi4aYq8lq0i6ndb64q_3eVaex007j1Coh9bx5OM4gi4GFOgbHtsowIMpShCju7PQ=s1424\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgmht-2dq5Zyjo-sEvWtUnhrElyodtAIyygsm-8j5grC08bzmj32HSsVN6rZW2hPw0o-05csNLdDQ5fwiJ_OqwQuSHW5iEJYF2etSKgtdgMw9pzgYq_qLmmNv7VGLGi4aYq8lq0i6ndb64q_3eVaex007j1Coh9bx5OM4gi4GFOgbHtsowIMpShCju7PQ=w450-h640\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjE_neE6_4XUe-pXTtXjCK9gOusgvQLNo2b4-FQRGag-YMoFWsCMCE6UqRQpRdmcpPFAm3zo8wVLCKpHZJabzLZH1_ZnG2JdGr0j9A0IYEFUtvLW87f81VRmLSQm1kx1TXNM3miETOPDu4SB43jlNz33yP4CoKBUVr4jabzUmGMXbhLPv8SWTILv-K5jQ=s4300\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"4300\" height=\"452\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjE_neE6_4XUe-pXTtXjCK9gOusgvQLNo2b4-FQRGag-YMoFWsCMCE6UqRQpRdmcpPFAm3zo8wVLCKpHZJabzLZH1_ZnG2JdGr0j9A0IYEFUtvLW87f81VRmLSQm1kx1TXNM3miETOPDu4SB43jlNz33yP4CoKBUVr4jabzUmGMXbhLPv8SWTILv-K5jQ=w640-h452\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\"><div align=\"center\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: large; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">（捐款可抵稅，匯款後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(定期定額) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(單筆) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</div></span><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div></span></span></h3><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #050505; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></span></div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left;\"></span></div><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 15px;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span><br /><span style=\"color: #999999;\"><br /></span></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: medium;\"></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
